# Sneak {R} needs red mana: Bot1's only source is a Mox Pearl, so in the declare blockers step of an unblocked attack the sneak is refused and the Ornithopter stays attacking.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Ornithopter
Jennika's Technique
Island x4
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Ornithopter > Bot2)
[T3 Bot1.DeclareBlockers]
! Bot1.Hand.Jennika's Technique.Cast(Ability: Sneak; Mana: short)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Pearl; Ornithopter
Bot1.Hand.Jennika's Technique.Colors = Red
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 0
